    "category": "Automatic catchweighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["HSC350", "HSC350/03", "HSC350/06", "HSC350/15", "HSC350/30"],
    "description": "Family of automatic weighing instruments operating as automatic checkweighers (Category X) and/or weigh or weigh-price labellers (Category Y). Constructed in stainless steel: fabricated floor-standing frame on adjustable feet carrying a modular conveyor (conveyor type, number, size and shape not restricted). Category X instruments may be equipped with reject devices (flipper, drop flap, ram or air blast); Category Y instruments with thermal label printers. Control cabinet behind the instrument houses the electrical hardware; a PL30 weighing indicator console mounted above the cabinet contains the keyboard and displays; photocells on the frame provide pack detection. Designed for permanent installation. Alternatives: 'R chain' transport system (two 1/4-inch plastic chains sliding on plastic bars instead of rollers); PL30 indicator enclosed in the cabinet; multi-lane configuration with each lane operated by a separate PL30 and a common cabinet."
